  "new_claims": [
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-1",
      "text": "唐僧离开后，孙悟空跳到树上，被打倒的女子在地上打滚哀鸣，孙悟空自在地打着秋千，半晌后女子才渐渐平复。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 5,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000005.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000005",
          "chapter_order": 5,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "唐僧走了，孙悟空跳到树上"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-2",
      "text": "孙悟空对女子说：不是可怜她，只是不杀没还手之力的人，让她现在出招。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0002/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0002"
      },
      "revealed_at": 5,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000005.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000005",
          "chapter_order": 5,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "只是老孙不杀没还手之力的人"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-3",
      "text": "女子对孙悟空说“你还是老样子”，问他是否还记得两人第一次见面，说她当时他也在树上那样躺着，是蟠桃树。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "林中女子"
      },
      "revealed_at": 5,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000005.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000005",
          "chapter_order": 5,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "是蟠桃树"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-4",
      "text": "孙悟空回称自己从没见过她，也没见过蟠桃树，要她随便亮个招数让他打死，不要浪费时间。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0002/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0002"
      },
      "revealed_at": 5,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000005.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000005",
          "chapter_order": 5,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "大婶我从没见过你"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-5",
      "text": "女子追问孙悟空是否不记得她是谁、是否已忘了从前的一切。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "林中女子"
      },
      "revealed_at": 5,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000005.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000005",
          "chapter_order": 5,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "你难道已忘了从前的一切"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-6",
      "text": "孙悟空自称五年前刚从五岳山地牢被放出来，一心想多杀几个妖怪积功德值，好让上天销了前罪，没准还封个土地山神。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0002/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0002"
      },
      "revealed_at": 5,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000005.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000005",
          "chapter_order": 5,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "五年前刚从五岳山地牢被放出来"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-7",
      "text": "女子反问“五岳山？是五行山才对呀”，并质疑：既然孙悟空记得自己做的事，又怎是杀几个妖天庭就会放过他的。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "林中女子"
      },
      "revealed_at": 5,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000005.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000005",
          "chapter_order": 5,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "销前罪？你也记得你做的事"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-8",
      "text": "孙悟空自称本是花果山一妖猴，因不敬天帝而被天帝罚入五岳关了五百年，后蒙玉帝开恩，说只要他完成三件事就赎了前罪，并说自己以前的事记得清清楚楚。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0002/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0002"
      },
      "revealed_at": 5,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000005.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000005",
          "chapter_order": 5,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我本是花果山一妖猴"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-9",
      "text": "女子追问是哪三件事，孙悟空答第一件是保“刚才那个秃头上西天”，第二件是杀四个魔王，第三件要等前两事做完上天才会告诉他。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0002/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0002"
      },
      "revealed_at": 5,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000005.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000005",
          "chapter_order": 5,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "要我保刚才那个秃头上西天"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-10",
      "text": "孙悟空列出四个魔王：西贺牛洲平天大圣牛魔王、北俱芦洲混天大圣鹏魔王、南瞻部洲通天大圣猕猴王，以及东胜神洲齐天大圣美猴王。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0002/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0002"
      },
      "revealed_at": 5,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000005.txt",
